# Polarion Integration - Test Case Management

**MCP Server Name**: `user-polarion`

**User's Primary Project**: `RHACM4K`

**SSL Note**: Uses wrapper at `/Users/ashafi/Documents/work/ai/tools/mcp/polarion/polarion-mcp-wrapper.py`

## Available Tools (25 total: 14 base + 11 enhanced)

**Read Tools:**
`check_polarion_status`, `get_polarion_project`, `get_polarion_work_items`, `get_polarion_work_item`, `get_polarion_work_items_details`, `get_polarion_work_item_revisions`, `get_polarion_test_steps`, `get_polarion_test_case_summary`, `get_polarion_setup_html`, `list_polarion_test_runs`, `get_polarion_test_run_info`, `list_polarion_plans`

**Write Tools:**
`update_polarion_work_item`, `update_polarion_setup`, `update_polarion_test_steps`, `create_polarion_test_run`, `upload_polarion_test_results`

**Write Tool Notes:**
- `update_polarion_test_steps`: If no steps exist, POST. If exist, PATCH in-place (1-indexed). Step count must match.
- `create_polarion_test_run`: Two-step (POST + PATCH for plan via `plannedin`).
- All enhanced tools have 30s timeout (vs base 8s)

**Tools with Issues:**
- `get_polarion_projects`: 403 Forbidden (normal - use specific project ID)
- `get_polarion_work_item_text`: Returns empty for some items (use `fields="@all"` instead)

**Authentication:** JWT PAT, expires Jan 31, 2027, subject: `ashafi`

## Permission Model

- Can read+write on RHACM4K (view, search, update, create test runs, upload results)
- Cannot: list all projects (403), delete work items/test runs/steps (403), POST steps when exist (400)

## Query Syntax (Lucene)

**Verified Fields:** `type`, `status`, `caselevel`, `casecomponent`, `testtype`, `subtype1`, `caseposneg`, `caseimportance`, `caseautomation`, `author.id`, `title`, `description`, `product`

**Broken Fields:** `subcomponent`, `tags`

**Default Search Context:**
- `author.id`: `ashafi`
- `casecomponent`: `virtualization` OR `Cluster Lifecycle`
- `type`: `testcase`

**Query Examples:**
```lucene
type:testcase AND author.id:ashafi AND casecomponent:virtualization AND status:proposed
type:testcase AND title:"[FG-RBAC-2.16]"
type:testcase AND product:rhacm2-16
```

## Batch Lookup

`work_item_ids` must be a **comma-separated string**, NOT an array:
```python
get_polarion_work_items_details(project_id="RHACM4K", work_item_ids="RHACM4K-61726,RHACM4K-61727")
```

## Limitations & Workarounds

| Limitation | Workaround |
|------------|------------|
| No Project Discovery (403) | Always use `project_id="RHACM4K"` |
| Can't DELETE test steps (403) | PATCH in-place; step count must match |
| Can't POST steps when exist (400) | Use PATCH on individual steps (1-indexed) |
| Text Extraction Bug | Use `fields="@all"` instead of `get_polarion_work_item_text` |

**Token Refresh:** `check_polarion_status` -> `set_polarion_token(token="NEW")` -> `get_polarion_project(project_id="RHACM4K")`

## Creating Test Cases (Complete Procedure)

**CRITICAL: The correct work_item_type is `testcase` (all lowercase). Using `testCase` (camelCase) creates a broken item without test steps schema.**

**Write passcode:** `adminATOMS` (hardcoded in base package, not configurable)

**Strategy:** Get everything right in the initial POST -- our PAT cannot PATCH work items (403). Two calls total:
1. `create_polarion_work_item` -- creates the item with description, setup, and all custom fields
2. `update_polarion_test_steps` -- POSTs test steps (only works when item has 0 existing steps)

### Step-by-step procedure:

```
# 1. Create the test case with ALL fields in one shot
create_polarion_work_item(
  passcode="adminATOMS",
  project_id="RHACM4K",
  work_item_type="testcase",           # MUST be lowercase
  title="[Area-Version] Area - Test Name",
  description="<HTML description>",     # Polarion HTML format
  status="draft",
  additional_fields='{
    "setup": {"type": "text/html", "value": "<HTML setup content>"},
    "caseimportance": "high",
    "caselevel": "system",
    "testtype": "functional",
    "caseposneg": "positive",
    "caseautomation": "notautomated",
    "casecomponent": "Console",
    "tags": "ui"
  }'
)

# 2. POST test steps (separate endpoint, only works on empty item)
update_polarion_test_steps(
  project_id="RHACM4K",
  work_item_id="RHACM4K-XXXXX",
  steps_json='[
    {"step_html": "<HTML step content>", "expected_result_html": "<HTML expected>"},
    ...
  ]'
)
```

### Key rules:
- `work_item_type` MUST be `testcase` (lowercase) -- camelCase creates a broken item
- `setup` goes in `additional_fields` as rich text: `{"type": "text/html", "value": "..."}`
- Custom fields go directly in `additional_fields` as flat key-value
- Description uses the `description` parameter (plain HTML string)
- Test steps are a SEPARATE POST after creation (the teststeps endpoint)
- NEVER rely on PATCH -- our PAT gets 403 on all PATCH operations
- If you need to fix a test case, you must create a new one (no updates possible)

### Valid custom field values:
- `caseimportance`: `critical`, `high`, `medium`, `low`
- `caselevel`: `system`, `integration`, `component`
- `testtype`: `functional`, `nonfunctional`
- `caseposneg`: `positive`, `negative`
- `caseautomation`: `notautomated`, `automated`, `manualonly`
- `casecomponent`: `Console` (default -- always use unless user explicitly specifies otherwise)
- `tags`: `ui` (minimum -- add more space-separated tags as relevant, e.g., `ui clusters markdown preview`)

### HTML format for steps:
Each step object needs `step_html` (actions) and `expected_result_html` (expected results). Use the Polarion HTML style: `<span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#000000;line-height:1.5;">` wrapper, `<span style="font-weight:bold;">` for titles, `&bull;` for bullets, `<br>` for line breaks, `<span style="font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:10pt">` for code.

### Title patterns by area:
- Clusters: `[Clusters-5.0] Clusters - Test Name`
- Governance: `[GRC-5.0] Governance - Test Name`
- RBAC: `[FG-RBAC-5.0] RBAC - Test Name`
- Virtualization: `[FG-RBAC-5.0] Fleet Virtualization - Test Name`
- Search: `[FG-RBAC-5.0] Search - Test Name`
- Applications: `[Apps-5.0] Applications - Test Name`

